// PROFILE TEST ENDPOINTS

### POST Create a profile
POST {{ BASE_URL }}/api/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "James",
  "bio": "Second year CS student interested in tutoring COMP classes.",
  "major": "Computer Science",
  "yearOfStudy": 2,

  "isTutor": true,
  "isTutee": true,

  "tutorCourseIds": [4,8,12,16],
  "tuteeCourseIds": [3,9],

  "availability": [
    { "day": "MON", "startMin": 540, "endMin": 660 },
    { "day": "WED", "startMin": 840, "endMin": 960 }
  ]
}

### GET a users information (ME)
GET {{ BASE_URL }}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

